WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:02.190
- Everyone loves sauce,
(curious mellow funky music)

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.000
but in Korea, there is one sauce

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.760
that goes on everything: gochujang.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.684
It's tangy, it's sweet, it's spicy.

00:00:09.684 --> 00:00:11.810
And in Korea, no one makes it better

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.670
than the people in this small town.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.972
Welcome to Sunchang Village.

00:00:15.972 --> 00:00:19.972
(moves into funky spacey music)

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:26.974
(moves into curious playful music)

00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:30.891
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.680
Meet Seo Youngsoon.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.040
She's been making gochujang for 40 years.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.957
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:55.496 --> 00:00:59.480
Gochujang gets its taste from
fermented soy bean bricks.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.720
Sunchang Village has a
naturally humid climate

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:03.680
that is perfect for fermenting the beans.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:04.638
(rattling)

00:01:04.638 --> 00:01:08.555
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:21.262
(rustling)

00:01:21.262 --> 00:01:25.179
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:28.186
(rattling)

00:01:28.186 --> 00:01:29.930
But Seo Youngsoon likes to let

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:31.899
hers ferment a little bit longer.

00:01:31.899 --> 00:01:35.816
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:45.154 --> 00:01:46.830
(moves into pleasant
playful orchestral music)

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.230
Seo Youngsoon doesn't want
her town's famous sauce

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.915
to be forgotten, so she
offers workshops to visitors

00:01:51.915 --> 00:01:54.580
in the hopes they will learn
how to make her special sauce

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.384
and continue the gochujang tradition.

00:01:57.384 --> 00:01:58.217
(murmuring)

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:02.134
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:22.411 --> 00:02:24.744
(squishing)

00:02:26.873 --> 00:02:29.290
(sonic wave)

